    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SYSTEM TIMETABLE, EFFECTIVE JULY 10, 1952\nUNITED\nTHIS YEAR\nTAKE A LOW COST\nJET COACH HOLIDAY\n(see map page)",
      "FOR INFORMATION\nOR RESERVATIONS\nYOUR TRAVEL AGENT OR UNITED AIR\nCALL\nLINES.\nSan Francisco.\nOukland..\nawards\nJE 8-1600\nMarin County.\n....OU 83774\nPalo Alto - Mountain View\n*...... YO 7-0900\nRodwood City.......EM 6-8201\nDowntown Airline Terminal\n375 O'Farrell Street, San Francisco\nEX 7-2100\n-TE 1-5500\nRichmend.\nSan Jose..\nSan Mateo.\nCY 7-2466\nOX 7-7000\nWalnut Creek..... YE 4-1600\nFEBRUARY-1963\nMARCH-1963\n17\n24\n31\nCoononical Refocee-Fie fandy Pae -12.00 con Needs Freugh 1200 reen Thursdas.\n255809\n1989,05.101)\nFAR AHEAD\nON JET FREIGHT LIFT\n• plus top Cargoliner service\n(soo schedules inside back cover)",
      "VANCOUVER\nSEATTLE TACOMA\nSPOKANE\nPENDLETON\nBOISE\nELKO\nHONOLULU\nPORTLAND\nSALEM\nEUGENE\nMEDFORD\nSAN FRANCISCO\nOAKLAND\nSALINAS\nMONTEREY\nRENO\nCRAMENTO\nSTOCKTON\nMODESTO\nMERCED\nFRESNO\nVISALIA\nBAKERSFIELD\nSANTA BARBARA\nLUS ANGELES\nLONG BEACH\nSAN DIEGO\nSALT LAKE CITY\nGRAND JUNCTION\nDENVER\nAS VEGA\nMINNEAPOLIS /ST. PAUL\nSAGINAW BAY CITY MIDLAND\nFLINT\nLARS\nGRAND PAPIOS\nROCHESTER\nBUFFALO.\nBOSTON\nHARTEORO SPRINGFIELD\nHA CORNING\nPROVIDENCE\nDETROIT\nCEDAR RA\nPORT WAYNE\nTOLEDO\nAKRON CANTO\nPITTSBURGH\nWILLIAMSPO\nYOUNGSTOWN WARRE\nNEWARK\nSHARON\nALLENTOWN BETHLEHEM EASTON\nPHILADELPHIA\nDESH\nOMAHA\nMOLINE ROCK ISCAND DAVENPORT\nDAYTON\nCOLUMBUS\nLINCOLN\nBALTIMORE\nWASHINGTON\nNEWPORT NEWS\nHAMPTON /WILLIAMSBURG\nCHARLESTON\nRICHMOND\nBRIST\nNORFOLK PORTSMOUTH\nJOHNSON CITY KINGSPORT\nKANSAS CIT\nGREENSBORO HIGH POINT\nKNOXVILLE\nWINSTON-SALEM\nASHEVILLE\nCHATTANOOGA\nRALEIGH DURHAM\nCHARLOTT\nMEMPHIS\nHUNTSVILLE DECATUR\nATLANTA\nJACKSONVILLE\nMOBILE\nTAMPA\nST. PETERSBURG\nCLEARWATER\nUNITED FLIES BY ELGIN WATCH TIME\nWEST PALM BEACH\nFORT LAUDERDALE\nMIAMI\nUNITED SERVES MORE FAVORITE VACATION CENTERS\nBY JET THAN ANY OTHER AIRLINE. For an exciting change of scenery\nconsider these economical holidays:\nSEATTLE... One of the biggest travel events of this or any year is the Seattle World's Fair. Through October 21, visit the\nFair, then see the Cascades, Puget Sound, Olympic Mountains and many other splendors of the great Northwest. United\nserves Seattle with more jets than any other airline.\nLOS ANGELES... Visit Disneyland, the movie studios, Knotts Berry Farm ... or see Bubbles the Whale perform at Marine-\nland of the Pacific. United serves Los Angeles with jets from more major cities than any other airline.\nHAWAII... Enjoy a catamaran sail ... surf and sun at beautiful Waikiki Beach ... visit Pearl Harbor, Pali Pass, or the\ncolorful neighboring islands... and United offers 36 jet flights a week to Honolulu from the Mainland.\nNEW YORK... Visit Greenwich Village, the many museums, the Empire State Building... Shop along fabulous Fifth\nAvenue, see top Broadway plays. United offers more jets to this international gateway city than any other airline.\nFor further information call United Air Lines or see your Travel Agent.\nUNITED"
